        "original_id": "31e99032-08b1-5bd8-bd53-65437e67dbac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Coco, Micki & Maude\n- People: Alan Jay Lerner, André Previn, Coco Chanel, Ann Reinking, Amy Irving\n- Topics: Broadway musicals, musical theater\n\nFacts:\n- Coco was a 1969 Broadway musical with a book and lyrics by Alan Jay Lerner and music by André Previn.\n- Coco was inspired by the life of Coco Chanel.\n- André Previn was born Andreas Ludwig Priwin on April 6, 1929, and he was a German-American pianist, conductor, and composer.\n- Ann Reinking starred in the 1969 Broadway production of Coco.\n- Micki & Maude co-starred Tony Award-winning actress and dancer Ann Reinking as Micki and Amy Irving as Maude.",
